{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "a1e6f2a0-4b8e-4c3e-9b4a-activities-board-api",
		"name": "ActivitiesBoard API",
		"description": "API REST de ActivitiesBoard (Sanctum, nivel de usuario, multi-tenant).\n\n**Antes de correr:**\n1. Seteá la variable de colección `email` / `password` con un usuario que exista en el tenant `pong.localhost`.\n2. Corré la colección con el Collection Runner de arriba hacia abajo (Auth → Categories → Activities → Activity Logs → Errores → Cleanup): cada request encadena el `token`/`id` que necesita el siguiente vía variables de colección.\n3. La carpeta `Cleanup` borra todo lo creado durante la corrida (logs, activity, categorías) y cierra sesión, para poder re-correr la colección las veces que hagan falta sin acumular basura.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{
				"key": "token",
				"value": "{{token}}",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
	"variable": [
		{ "key": "base_url", "value": "http://pong.localhost", "type": "string" },
		{ "key": "email", "value": "owner@pong.test", "type": "string" },
		{ "key": "password", "value": "secret123", "type": "string" },
		{ "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
		{ "key": "category_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
		{ "key": "category_id_2", "value": "", "type": "string" },
		{ "key": "activity_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
		{ "key": "log_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
		{ "key": "client_uuid", "value": "", "type": "string" }
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "1. Auth",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Login",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"pm.test('login ok', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
									"const json = pm.response.json();",
									"pm.test('token presente', () => pm.expect(json.token).to.be.a('string'));",
									"pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": { "type": "noauth" },
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
						},
						"url": "{{base_url}}/activities-board/api/auth/login"
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Me",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"pm.test('me ok', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
									"pm.test('trae email', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().email).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('email')));"
								]
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"url": "{{base_url}}/activities-board/api/auth/me"
					}
				}
			]
		},
